 "notes": "Cat tree: Catit Vesper and Natural Paradise ceiling models made archetypes (versions from catit.com and old data); SKU list trimmed to 8 flat models (dropped near-duplicate Trixie/Frisco/Go Pet Club/Natural Paradise SKUs). Cat scratcher trimmed from 22 to 10 market brands; cheap marketplace brands (Coching, Fukumaru, MECOOL, SHENGOCASE, PetMaker, ScratchMe, PetnPurr, Catinsider, Cat Craft, PetPals) dropped. Wall-mounted cat furniture keeps old source; Catastrophic Creations archetype added. New kinds Cat bed, Cat toy, Cat harness and lead sourced. Left out: laser-toy and catnip-kicker brands, radiator-bed makers, Petstages scratchers and Catastrophic Creations founding year (no retrieved page confirmed them); catster.com blocked (403). Catit country and Go Cat country rest on brand pages/retailer context, not retrieved corporate records."
